    :ruleText "IF Chest pain AND Pain radiating to the arm, shoulder, neck or jaw AND (Significantly increased sweating OR Feeling nauseous or do you feel like vomiting OR Experiencing shortness of breath or difficulty breathing in a significant way) AND NOT Symptoms that are increased with physical exertion but alleviated with rest THEN Possible NSTEMI / STEMI (CF +0.60)"@en ;
