    :ruleText "IF Rhinosinusitis symptoms (EPOS: >= 2, one nasal) AND Chronic sinusitis, nasal polyps or septal deviation AND NOT Fever (either felt or measured with a thermometer) THEN Chronic rhinosinusitis (CF +0.60)"@en ;
