    :ruleText "IF Swelling in one or more areas of your body AND (Take a calcium channel blockers (medication) OR Taking or have you recently taken anti-inflammatory drugs (NSAIDs) OR Known kidney problem resulting in an inability to retain proteins OR Liver cirrhosis OR Heart failure OR Surgery to remove lymph nodes OR Endocrine disease or a hormone dysfunction OR Obstructive sleep apnea (OSA) OR Deep vein thrombosis (DVT) OR Take corticosteroids OR Known issue with one of your heart valves) THEN Localized edema (CF +0.50)"@en ;
