                                    :onEvidence :E_129 ] ) ] [ a :EvidencePresent ;
                        :onEvidence :E_9 ] [ a :EvidencePresent ;
                        :onEvidence :E_66 ] ) ] ;
    :ruleIndex 146 ;
    :ruleText "IF (Diffuse (widespread) redness in one or both eyes OR Joint pain OR Lesions, redness or problems on your skin that you believe are related to the condition you are consulting for) AND Swollen or painful lymph nodes AND Experiencing shortness of breath or difficulty breathing in a significant way THEN Sarcoidosis (CF +0.50)"@en ;
